  "independent_scope": "Whole native selected-source content on both mattes, all9 selected poses plus adopted neutral at inherited maximum body reference 430.000000px across5both-matte pages, and all7 decoded discrete recipe rows actually viewed. Historical unselected sheet cells are not accepted by viewing their whole source. Physical UI zoom/density and real-time/interpolated/MP4 output not measured.",
  "observations": [
    "Actually inspected fresh quiet blink and two four-gesture split originals in full native light/dark. Long paired pink ears, brown forehead with sparse darker fur marks, white muzzle/belly, oval white-surrounded brown eyes, two forepaws, two feet and one white side tail remain connected and uncut. Source edges/gutters do not cut ears or paws in selected crops; no stray background field or dirty color slab found.",
    "At inherited body-reference430, quiet blink closely retains neutral ear tips/crown/chin/torso and support. All eight active gestures keep compact body and leg scale; connected rounded paws and gaze give readable left/right, greeting, cheek think/aha and two-paw cheer.",
    "Species A is a small head/ear tilt followed by settling to B; long ears keep their shape/length without extra ears. All seven decoded static recipe rows observed in both mattes with coherent support and clear outlines. Only fixed handoffv004 geometry/selected pixels were reviewed, not rejected prior draft calibrations."
  ],
